Subject: [PATCH 10/12] sherlock-lfr: E4 profile harness and GPU equality tests

e4_profile: one L_Fr prove at the L_Fr set with stage spans, proof bytes and
peak RSS, cached proving key. e4_gpu_hash: GPU Poseidon rows, digest layers and
fused encode equal the CPU. Feature gpu enables openvm-stark-sdk/gpu. The
stark-backend patch points at the stark-backend-e4 worktree.
